{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shiyi-e-aae41a560987e1540679","title":"是仪为鲁王傅尽忠规谏","accounts":[{"id":"shiyi-a-aae41a560987e1540679","label":"正文","text":"是仪为鲁王傅尽忠规谏","evidence":["shiyi-q-066a979c09ea115e1d59"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shiyi-p-ef2e1c7010751a","role":"规谏者","evidence":["shiyi-q-066a979c09ea115e1d59"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["shiyi-q-066a979c09ea115e1d59"]},"ordering_evidence":"shiyi-q-066a979c09ea115e1d59","order":10800}],"persons":[{"id":"shiyi-p-ef2e1c7010751a","name":"是仪","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shiyi-q-066a979c09ea115e1d59","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18ef2ce50d8fb8def8db","layer":"original","quote":"南、鲁二宫初立〖1〗，仪以本职领鲁王傅。仪嫌二宫相近切〖2〗，乃上疏曰：“臣窃以鲁王天挺懿德〖3〗，兼资文武；当今之宜，宜镇四方，为国藩辅。宣扬德美，广耀威灵；乃国家之良规，海内所瞻望。但臣言辞鄙野，不能究尽其意。愚以二宫，宜有降杀〖4〗；正上下之序，明教化之本。”书三四上。为傅尽忠，动辄规谏。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
